        "explanation_ar": "Here you are تقال عند إعطاء شيء لشخص. Here is + الشيء تقدّم شيئًا محددًا.",
        "explanation_en": "\"Here you are\" = when you give something. \"Here is ...\" names the thing.",
        "examples": [
          {
            "word": "Here you are",
            "sentence": "Sure, here you are."
          },
          {
            "word": "Here is",
            "sentence": "Here is your lunch!"
          }
        ]
      }
